    <item>
      <title>Version 1.3.0</title>
      <description><![CDATA[New: at-a-glance system metrics on the Dashboard — overall load plus CPU, GPU, memory and disk, each with its real measurement. New: live system power draw on the Power card and in the menu-bar panel. New app icon. Fixed: a crash when opening the menu-bar panel. Fixed: fan-control helper setup could get stuck — Repair now rebuilds a stale registration. Improved: clearer temperature colours, and the panel fan slider now shows live RPM and reaches its true minimum. Plus a broad audit pass hardening the fan-control fail-safes.]]></description>
